      "headline": "Nawrocki establishes New Constitution Council on May 3; Tusk dismisses initiative as 'political game'",
      "summary": "President Nawrocki used the May 3 Constitution Day celebrations to formally establish a Council for a New Constitution, appointing its first members\u2014including controversial former Constitutional Tribunal president Julia Przy\u0142\u0119bska\u2014and calling for a 'new generation constitution by 2030.' Prime Minister Tusk responded publicly that the existing constitution should be respected first, called the initiative a 'political game,' and argued there is no parliamentary supermajority to change it. Defense Minister Kosiniak-Kamysz proposed enshrining EU membership in the constitution instead.",
